cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to PRISMatic or the PRISM framework, please cite it as below."
title: "PRISMatic — PRISM WP3 PET recyclability decision demonstrator"
abstract: >-
  PRISMatic is the proof-of-concept demonstrator for PRISM (Physics-Informed Recyclability
  Identification through Spectroscopic and Mechanical Modelling), a physics-informed decision
  framework that infers the degradation state of unknown-history post-consumer PET
  from its ATR-FTIR/NIR spectral fingerprint, predicts its mechanical profile, and recommends a
  mechanical / hybrid / chemical recycling route by weighing technical, chemical and
  sustainability criteria, with end-use valorisation. All values are illustrative placeholders.
